Meta.documentation:Number.round
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Rounds each Number to the nearest integer.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Streaming operator: half rounds up (round(3.5) is 4).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_default_$all — each Number
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number_default — the rounded result
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:Number:3.5>>Number.round:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:4
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.floor Number.ceil
